                        "sense_id": "46724671-36ee-3704-a2b7-774b158a9778",
                        "entry_id": "40f31159-20eb-37be-a9a5-f73ba559c411",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not ornamented; without ornament."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1221a9ca-3fe2-4c04-898e-27e5026f0b1b",
                                "sense_id": "46724671-36ee-3704-a2b7-774b158a9778",
                                "text": "Well, I lay it down, first, that a book quite unornamented can look actually and positively beautiful, and not merely un-ugly, if it be, so to say, architecturally good, which, by the by, need not add much to its price […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa2d67cf-9a24-4c26-84b3-e270e98a8460",
                                "sense_id": "46724671-36ee-3704-a2b7-774b158a9778",
                                "text": "The many repetitions of unornamented locomotor movement describing great diagonals do eventually wear."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
